WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.456 --> 00:00:10.440
From the moment the makeup starts through travel, greeting guests, and the end of the event, a wedding parent needs the look to hold for at least five hours.

2
00:00:10.776 --> 00:00:18.744
To achieve this, we use a layering technique, patting on very thin coats of foundation multiple times instead of one thick layer, to maximize how well it adheres.

3
00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:26.376
We also carefully use waterproof products and a makeup setting spray to guard against tears or sweat, so the fresh look lasts until the ceremony is over.

4
00:00:26.712 --> 00:00:31.200
The most important thing is a hydration-focused skincare routine on the morning of the wedding.

5
00:00:31.536 --> 00:00:40.128
Since skin is alive and breathes, makeup gets absorbed over time, so a skilled artist accounts for that absorption when applying it.

6
00:00:40.464 --> 00:00:46.656
If you have oily skin that absorbs makeup unusually fast, be sure to mention that in advance.

7
00:00:46.992 --> 00:00:52.488
That way, we can apply a finish specifically suited to oily skin that absorbs makeup quickly.
